Secrets: git-ignored (only this file is kept).

SSH key for logging in to the devices. Make one:
  ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N '' -C wyse -f keys/wyse_ed25519
Then put the contents of keys/wyse_ed25519.pub in .env as SSH_PUBLIC_KEY.

One file per device, device.<any name>, one value per line:
  3040        model (3040 or 5020)
  shop-01     host name
  ...         SSH host key, NetBird key, Tailscale key
Write the first two lines; the build adds the keys (scripts/device-keys.sh).
Keep a copy: without these keys a device gets new VPN identities.
